            {
              "text": ".",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Kasodi aibirokin kiŋaren kakejeke, aima ŋes, Katema ŋesi eoŋ atiar, “Koany, sirikiswama kwaŋin! Arai eoŋ ebulesit aupakon, ka lokoinacanakon, luejaas kaitejenunet naka Yesu. Koma Edeke.” Naarai aitejenunet naka Yesu ŋes emoyo loka adwaranut.",
          "type": "text",
