        },
        {
          "text": " Elomuni ekileŋ loekwana kaitukuke, loinomia atekerin, icokiei kes kebela loka asuat; icakacakai ŋesi acuet naka ebino loka adedeŋ naka anyunyura naka Edeke Lokapedor kere, ",
